    "title": "Vescueye",
    "description": "This project develops a near-infrared (NIR) device for real-time artery detection and blood flow assessment in microvascular surgeries, especially oral and reconstructive. Featuring a cloud server and a UI, it enhances precision, monitors perfusion, and improves outcomes post-surgery.",
